# Application mapper

Declare `IMapper` in Application. Handlers call typed `Map(...)` overloads. For the reference layout, implement `Mapper` in Api and register it in the service's Api setup. A stateless mapper with singleton-safe dependencies can use singleton lifetime.

Keep Protobuf conversions at this boundary. Check scalar presence with `Has…` when absence matters. Set optional response fields only when their domain values are present. Preserve the distinction between a calendar date and an instant.
